#compdef __rust_compile

# `__rust_compile BODY [LINE]`: compile an inline `rust { ... }` block. The
# parser emits it with the base64-encoded body and the source line
# (src/rust_ffi.rs); it is not typed by hand.
#
# zshrs builtin. Bundled into ~/.zshrs/functions by build.rs.

_arguments ':base64-encoded rust body:' ':source line number:'
